{"id":"0920735961e5851c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kurtz-hierarchy.md","title":"Schnorr 随机性严格强于 Kurtz 随机性","display":"thm-kurtz-hierarchy — Schnorr 随机性严格强于 Kurtz 随机性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kurtz-hierarchy","aliases":["43-thm-kurtz-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-kurtz-hierarchy — Schnorr 随机性严格强于 Kurtz 随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.5.1 Theorems 10.5.3–10.5.4；§10.5.5，印刷233–235、244–248，PDF253–255、264–268","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kurtz-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kurtz-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kurtz-hierarchy — Schnorr 随机性严格强于 Kurtz 随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.5.1 Theorems 10.5.3–10.5.4；§10.5.5，印刷233–235、244–248，PDF253–255、264–268"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b1a52dd1295c33c\" href=\"?note=1b1a52dd1295c33c\" title=\"43-df-kurtzrandom\">43-df-kurtzrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含由Kurtz有限闭开检验也是Schnorr检验；严格性在源书通过Kurtz随机c.e.实数及非高度现象展示。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.5.1 Theorems 10.5.3–10.5.4；§10.5.5，印刷233–235、244–248，PDF253–255、264–268。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；谓词见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；谓词见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtzrandom","status":"resolved","id":"1b1a52dd1295c33c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}(X)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kurtz-hierarchy]] — Schnorr 随机性严格强于 Kurtz 随机性"}],"outgoing":["1b1a52dd1295c33c","c8d43a74ea8721f3"]}